      "decision": "pushed_back",
      "source_file": "src/sqllens/memory/store.py",
      "claim_text": "The no-overlap / off-loop invariant is held only by call sites and tests, not by MemoryStore",
      "skip_category": "uncategorized",
      "evidence": "Design decision the issue settled: issue #303 Implementation Notes decision 1 places one async helper in store.py that call sites route the sync memory.admin functions through, and decision 2 keeps loop-side work on the loop; moving the invariant into MemoryStore's methods would redesign that seam (and the CLI exporter's synchronous path). Every MCP-tool call site is pinned by tests/unit/test_memory_event_loop.py, whose sync-method list is now derived from MemoryStore. Revisit when a new MemoryStore caller is added outside these sites."
    },
